---
description: Personal fork of mattpocock/skills. Overlays instead of editing upstream skills.
alwaysApply: true
---

This is a personal fork of mattpocock/skills. Read `FORK.md` before adding or editing skills.

When a change would touch an upstream skill, README, AGENTS.md, plugin manifest, or docs page, call the Skill tool with "overlay-skill" and write a new skill under `skills/personal/` instead.

When `grill-me` or `grilling` runs, call the Skill tool with "overlay-grilling" and apply that overlay. `/grill-me` stays the command; the overlay is how rounds are written.
